ja rõõmustame koos Tõrvaga

16
00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:16.330
ja soovime neile hästi palju õnne.

17
00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:39.480
Et so much, it shows the,
the cultural of the people's hide,

18
00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:43.440
they are haiged, cultural, you know,
so very beautiful, it was amazing.

19
00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:47.155
Why do people love Gurshvin music so
much?

20
00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:39.300
Mul selline tunne,
et Gurshvinil õnnestus kirjutada

21
00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:42.179
