106
00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:50.290
How do you pronounce Tõrva? I, oh,
that's my first time is here.

107
00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:53.255
I always called it Torva.

108
00:12:56.429 --> 00:13:00.309
Tõrva. Tõrva, tõrva, tõrva, okei, so.

109
00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:26.230
Kohe ei usukski seda,
et Tõrvast on võimalik leida

110
00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:29.710
